/-- The identification algorithm `A` is *fixed-budget* with budget `T`: it stops after exactly
`T` rounds. -/
def IsFixedBudget (A : IdentAlg 𝓞 𝓐 𝓨 𝓓) (T : ℕ) : Prop := A.stopSet = {h | h.1 = T}

